commit ccf61b64241fc8810e9ac5f7bf9a1fb4b2648972

C03: application openings accept the voseo clitic, «avrí», trailing «dale/porfa/pls», a stated clock time and bilingual catalog aliases (APPS1231 repair)

«me abrís la calculadora», «abrime la calculadora dale», «avrí la calculadora»,
«son las tres abrí la calculadora» and «open the file explorer» now resolve to
app.open on the installed catalog entry; the calculator/notepad/file-explorer
aliases are shared by the effect recogniser and the app-id resolver so the
English form names the same installed application. Owner reviews H0724 (a
clock time is context, never a schedule) and H0497 respected. Offline
recogniser baseline: only H0165 and H0724 gain a reading; no literal lost.
No tests (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


