commit 04645e826c2e0afb997faaabbd8dd4e19f03f89a

C03: «abre a calculadora» is a Spanish opening, not Portuguese, when a known application follows the article (APPS1231 repair b)

The confident Portuguese cue «abre/minimiza + o/a» abstains when the article is
followed by an application name shared by both surfaces (owner review H0497:
intent preserved, «a» for «la»). «abre o bloco de notas» still reads as
Portuguese. Offline recogniser baseline unchanged. No tests (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


